    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>, then the determinant&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>9</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
